{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/0c248940fc42fcef65e4985601678fd3.webp?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, expand, and customize your store! \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appraise and buy second-hand items! \ud83d\udd0e </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy cheaper than you could sell to profit! \ud83e\udd11 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new displays, lighting, and decor from your tablet! \ud83d\udecb\ufe0f </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay your utility bills and rent! \ud83d\udce8 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your reputation to unlock new content. \ud83c\udf1f </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/fa17d60f97f53d412e84f916a95d2af4.webp?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will come and go to your shop, browsing the items displayed.\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer's shopping and haggling behaviours will be different. \ud83e\udd20</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their emotions tend to swing a little bit daily to reflect real life and to eliminate monotony.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your regular customers and strategize based on their personality. \u265f\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study your audience and buy the kind of items you can sell easily.\ud83d\udc8e</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/bab105fc5551fd32ebb686275c767bb8.webp?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evaluate and appraise the item when a customer wants to sell you something; otherwise, you might get scammed! \ud83d\udcb8 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you have a price on your mind, don't forget to add a margin for profit! \ud83d\udcb0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We carefully designed the haggle interface for you to comprehend previous bids, current bids, a slider for making new bids, and customer information all at once. \ud83d\ude0e </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers have patience. Strategize your way by studying your opponent's moves. \ud83c\udfaf </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, not buying an item might be the best way to profit from it. \ud83d\ude0e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/f4d97dc82cc268af262ed19f5ab130ca.webp?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 unique items waiting to be evaluated interactively. \ud83c\udfbb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item evaluation consists of visual examination (labels, engravings, ornaments), interactive examination (latches, buttons, triggers), and power examination (powering up with batteries or an electric outlet). \ud83c\udffa </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All items have condition, brand, model, rarity, and overall market price information for you to decide the best price! \ud83e\uddd0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cannot decide what is the best price, you can take photos from multiple angles and send them to an expert to get a better opinion. \ud83e\udd13 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/3cdccc02ecbb52cb19f5381eb6a84dce.webp?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, we provide you with ways to attract more customers into your store and make them consider buying your displayed items. \ud83e\uddf2 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store attraction is calculated with what items you put in your storefront, closer to your store windows, neon signs, and store signboard. This is what makes a regular person on the street want to visit your store. \ud83d\udc65 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item attraction is calculated with synergy, which means the harmony between items in the same area. This is what makes a visitor a customer. \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udffc </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully design your store to attract more people to your store, rather than to your displayed items, to make the best deals and get rich! \ud83d\ude80 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/e34f54247f886101f3f015d1832697e5.poster.avif?t=1768303066\" width=720 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/e34f54247f886101f3f015d1832697e5.webm?t=1768303066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/e34f54247f886101f3f015d1832697e5.mp4?t=1768303066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/471bf67c1da508f58e911cf74a2e013b.avif?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=550 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our release date is to be announced soon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, we are planning to release a <i>Second-hand Clash Update</i>. Featuring storage wars, auctions, and 50+ new items. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, we plan to release a <i>Pawn Empire Update</i>. Featuring hiring employees, bank loans, and more financial mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, we are planning to release a <i>Customer Update</i>. Featuring new and more realistic customers with voice lines and visible emotions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to be announced after the release!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997360?t=1768303066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/bb4cba4456ff2ada34ee97d12f42d89302645d00/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768303066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/87ffbd7707d92c4a5b4fd185a9c5b7ade86e97bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768303066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/87ffbd7707d92c4a5b4fd185a9c5b7ade86e97bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768303066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4008940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/0c248940fc42fcef65e4985601678fd3.webp?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, expand, and customize your store! \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appraise and buy second-hand items! \ud83d\udd0e </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy cheaper than you could sell to profit! \ud83e\udd11 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new displays, lighting, and decor from your tablet! \ud83d\udecb\ufe0f </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay your utility bills and rent! \ud83d\udce8 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your reputation to unlock new content. \ud83c\udf1f </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/fa17d60f97f53d412e84f916a95d2af4.webp?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will come and go to your shop, browsing the items displayed.\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer's shopping and haggling behaviours will be different. \ud83e\udd20</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their emotions tend to swing a little bit daily to reflect real life and to eliminate monotony.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your regular customers and strategize based on their personality. \u265f\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study your audience and buy the kind of items you can sell easily.\ud83d\udc8e</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/bab105fc5551fd32ebb686275c767bb8.webp?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evaluate and appraise the item when a customer wants to sell you something; otherwise, you might get scammed! \ud83d\udcb8 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_parag