ame, we provide you with ways to attract more customers into your store and make them consider buying your displayed items. \ud83e\uddf2 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store attraction is calculated with what items you put in your storefront, closer to your store windows, neon signs, and store signboard. This is what makes a regular person on the street want to visit your store. \ud83d\udc65 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item attraction is calculated with synergy, which means the harmony between items in the same area. This is what makes a visitor a customer. \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udffc </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully design your store to attract more people to your store, rather than to your displayed items, to make the best deals and get rich! \ud83d\ude80 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/e34f54247f886101f3f015d1832697e5.poster.avif?t=1768303066\" width=720 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/e34f54247f886101f3f015d1832697e5.webm?t=1768303066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/e34f54247f886101f3f015d1832697e5.mp4?t=1768303066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/extras/471bf67c1da508f58e911cf74a2e013b.avif?t=1768303066\" width=616 height=550 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our release date is to be announced soon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, we are planning to release a <i>Second-hand Clash Update</i>. Featuring storage wars, auctions, and 50+ new items. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, we plan to release a <i>Pawn Empire Update</i>. Featuring hiring employees, bank loans, and more financial mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, we are planning to release a <i>Customer Update</i>. Featuring new and more realistic customers with voice lines and visible emotions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to be announced after the release!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Next Sky Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997360/966d6e36b79d311f4fa1d56792b2f5754f1ffbb3/header.jpg?t=1768303066","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997360/883109076/c8dcaaa214c6f5b42f5e682ec8ee28c2987f2881/1756476948/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756920937","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997360/883109076/c8dcaaa214c6f5b42f5e682ec8ee28c2987f2881/1756476948/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756920937","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997360/883109076/c8dcaaa214c6f5b42f5e682ec8ee28c2987f2881/1756476948/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756920937","id":257190750,"name":"Pawnbroker Simulator - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190750/7449d427cc625602df40a2641a2053b5d0209e98/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756920937"}],"name":"Pawnbroker Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bi